@startuml
[*] --> UNPAID : checkout / amountPaid = 0
[*] --> PARTIAL : checkout / 0 < amountPaid < total
[*] --> PAID : checkout / amountPaid = total
UNPAID --> PARTIAL : recordPayment(amount > 0)
UNPAID --> PAID : recordPayment(balance)
PARTIAL --> PARTIAL : recordPayment(amount < balance)
PARTIAL --> PAID : recordPayment(balance)
PAID --> [*]
UNPAID --> VOID : void sale (reserved / not exposed in current UI)
PARTIAL --> VOID : void sale (reserved / not exposed in current UI)
VOID --> [*]
note right of VOID : VOID is represented in the Sale enum,\nbut a void endpoint/UI is not implemented yet.
@enduml
